Z||000000||My7Fieros||11-12-2001||03:34 PM||||Woo hoo! Now, before someone asks "does that mean you're now My8Fieros?", no.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> I traded my Formula for it w/ NDFieroTN. Weve been talking about doing the trade for a while, and finally did it. Im pumped! Overall its in pretty good shape.....as for most any 17 year old car, its got its share of bugs here and there. 113,000 on the clock..runs, but not up to a daily driver status.<BR>Those of you who know me know that regardless, its getting the works. I'll repaint it and re-decal it (prob Phoenix Graphix), and Im going to rebuild the engine. This is my first 4 banger Fiero, and it feels good to have a "simple" engine (compared to the V6's) to work on. I'll drop the engine and give her a good clean rebuild. Cant wait! Pics to follow soon...............  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>Oh btw its an auto.||||reg||10
